 "Not one metre of shade on this promenade, which is why they are out at six.": "Nie een meter skaduwee op hierdie promenade nie — dis hoekom hulle sesuur al uit is.",
 "Not one of them is flying, and that is the whole forecast right there.": "Nie een van hulle vlieg nie, en daar het jy die hele voorspelling.",
 "Not one star made it through that lid, and nobody has noticed yet.": "Nie een ster het deur daardie deksel gekom nie, en niemand het dit nog agtergekom nie.",
 "Not rain. Just atmosphere with opinions.": "Nie reën nie. Net atmosfeer met menings.",
 "Not the time for hero moves, hey.": "Nie tyd vir heldedade nie, ne!",
 "Not weather you walk through.": "Nie weer waardeur jy loop nie.",
 "Nothing in the sky to slow the sun down, so the stoep warmed up before seven.": "Niks in die lug om die son te vertraag nie, so die stoep was voor sewe al warm.",
 "Nothing is falling and nothing is shining; it is that kind of night.": "Niks val nie en niks skyn nie; dis daai soort nag.",
 "Officially he’s watering the garden. The garden is third in the queue.": "Amptelik gee hy die tuin water. Die tuin is derde in die tou.",
 "One gust, one wall, and two households now know each other much better.": "Een windvlaag, een muur, en twee huishoudings ken mekaar nou heelwat beter.",
 "One last look at a sky that is about to get seriously cold.": "Een laaste kyk na 'n lug wat op die punt staan om ernstig koud te word.",
 "One lit window is taking on the whole fog, and losing beautifully.": "Een verligte venster vat die hele mis aan, en verloor pragtig.",
 "One look at that white lawn and the blanket vote was unanimous.": "Een kyk na daardie wit grasperk en die kombersstemming was eenparig.",
 "One night of proper rain and the driveway has joined the water table.": "Een nag se ordentlike reën en die oprit het by die watertafel aangesluit.",
 "One patch of sun came into this lounge and the dog got there first.": "Een kol son het in hierdie sitkamer ingekom en die hond was eerste daar.",
 "One perfect day issued. Non-transferable. Spend it wisely.": "Een perfekte dag uitgereik. Moet hom nie op admin mors nie.",
 "One person at this wedding is checking the sky, and she has been right before.": "Een persoon by hierdie troue hou die lug dop, en sy was al voorheen reg.",
 "One planet up, no clouds coming, and the whole dorp still outside.": "Een planeet op, geen wolke op pad nie, en die hele dorp is nog buite.",
 "One slipper is already out of the game and the cover is still winning.": "Een pantoffel is klaar uit die spel en die oortreksel wen steeds.",
 "One sunrise, used twice — once in the sky and once off the wet sand.": "Een sonsopkoms, twee keer gebruik — een keer in die lug en een keer van die nat sand af.",
 "One thin line of light at the horizon, and the whole sky leaning on it.": "Een dun streep lig op die horison, en die hele lug leun daarop.",
 "Orange to navy with nothing in between — the walk home slowed down for it.": "Oranje tot donkerblou met niks tussenin nie — die stap huis toe het stadiger geword daarvoor.",
 "Outside is a test of character. You're failing.": "Buite is 'n karaktertoets. Jy druip.",
 "Outside is closed until further notice.": "Buite is gesluit tot verdere kennisgewing.",
 "Outside is closed. Management is inside.": "Buite is gesluit. Bestuur is binne.",
 "Outside is for the stars tonight; everything with fur voted fireplace.": "Buite is vanaand vir die sterre; alles met pels het vir die kaggel gestem.",
 "Overcast this thick turns the Karoo into a corridor, and he is halfway down it.": "Wolke só dik maak van die Karoo 'n gang, en hy is halfpad daarin af.",
 "Pack an umbrella. Or don't. We don't know either.": "Pak 'n sambreel. Of moenie. Ons weet ook nie.",
 "Panels installed, sun absent: the sky owes this roof an apology.": "Panele geïnstalleer, son afwesig: die lug skuld hierdie dak 'n verskoning.",
 "Paving wet, clouds low, fire going anyway — this braai has been through worse.": "Plaveisel nat, wolke laag, vuur brand in elk geval — hierdie braai het al erger oorleef.",
 "Perfect conditions for losing your dignity.": "Perfekte toestande om jou waardigheid te verloor.",
 "Perfect day. No excuses. Get out.": "Perfekte dag. Geen verskonings nie. Gaan uit.",
