 "Perfect excuse to cancel plans.": "Perfekte verskoning om planne te kanselleer.",
 "Perfect for doing absolutely nothing.": "Perfek om absoluut niks te doen nie.",
 "Perfect night to actually see the Milky Way.": "Perfekte nag om die Melkweg te sien.",
 "Perfect weather for a horror movie.": "Perfekte weer vir n horror movie.",
 "Perfect weather for existing without enthusiasm.": "Perfekte weer vir bestaan sonder entoesiasme.",
